"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/75764132c>`__)."
msgstr ""
"修正了 H7 Plus 开发板的显示名称，使用下划线而非空格（\\ "
"``OpenMV_Cam_H7_Plus_(STM32H743_w/_SDRAM)``\\ ）（\\ `75764132c "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/75764132c>`__\\ ）。"

